(3) Maintenance and operation expenses or security and public safety expenses associated with capital outlay projects funded pursuant to subsection 11-304(b).
(Ord. No. 96-11, § 1, 4-01-96)

1253:
(a) The provisions of this article shall apply to the following commercial facilities:
